  "_price_sentinels_note": "Placeholder prices a retailer publishes for an item it will not actually sell. One chain shipped 10000000 on 7 offers in the first production run; it produced a 2037% 'gap' against a real price, which is exactly the kind of number the featured slot would have amplified into a wrong headline.",
